            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Stacy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very tasty! I used half the butter and added a few dashes of cayenne as we thought it needed more heat. Next time I will drain the Rotel, as it is a bit runny. We really liked the texture the corn added. Not what you usually find in a dip. Will for sure make again and again!",
            "datePublished": "2012-10-20T14:34:27.800Z"
